		{
			description: [
				"Before you get carried away, there's a tiny bit of setup you need to do before a laboratory will function."
				""
				"1. Place the laboratory in claimed chunks. To do this, open your map, click on a chunk, and select the option to claim it."
				""
				"The laboratory will now progress tech for the team/individual whose chunk it is in!"
				""
				"2. No more than 1 laboratory per team!*"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"*No more than 1 laboratory per tier, per team. According to a comment in the mod code. Try it, i'm curious."
			]
			id: "397573A0DF56787E"
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "This laboratory is out of order"
			tasks: [{
				id: "53C93D3B01DCF75E"
				title: "Setup Complete!"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Chunk Claiming Nonsense"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: ["Yes, yes, i know, this \"research\" thing is brand new and has you excited. But guess what: you'll need items to craft a lab. Crazy how that works."]
